---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import teamIliaAsset from '../assets/img/team-ilia.webp';
const teamIlia = teamIliaAsset.src;
import teamLeoAsset from '../assets/img/team-leo.webp';
const teamLeo = teamLeoAsset.src;
import teamSergioAsset from '../assets/img/team-sergio.webp';
const teamSergio = teamSergioAsset.src;
---

<Page title="About Fettle – London Handyman & Home Maintenance Team" description="A small permanent team, a short list of homes, and a simple promise – the same faces each visit, honest work, and a tidy finish. By recommendation, mostly.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">About Fettle</p>
        <h1>The friendly folk who keep your London home in good working order.</h1>
        <p class="lede">A small permanent team, a short list of homes, and a simple promise – the same faces each visit, honest work, and a tidy finish. By recommendation, mostly.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="prose" style="margin-top:0">Meet the team</h2>
        <p class="prose" style="color:var(--ink-60); margin-top:-8px">The small permanent team behind every visit &ndash; repairs, decorating, plumbing and cleaning.</p>
        <div class="grid four" style="margin-top:28px">
          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src={teamIlia} alt="Ilia" />
            </div>
            <p class="team-name">Ilia</p>
            <p class="team-role">Founder &middot; Surveys &amp; quotes</p>
            <p class="team-note">Inspection and quotation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src={teamLeo} alt="Leo" />
            </div>
            <p class="team-name">Leo</p>
            <p class="team-role">Maintenance &amp; decorating</p>
            <p class="team-note">Maintenance, painting, plastering, and decoration.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src={teamSergio} alt="Sergio" />
            </div>
            <p class="team-name">Sergio</p>
            <p class="team-role">Plumber &amp; repairs</p>
            <p class="team-note">Plumbing and general repairs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="team-card is-placeholder">
            <div class="team-photo" style="width:122px; height:122px;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="team-name">Hiring</p>
            <p class="team-note"><a href="/contact">Good hands wanted &ndash; get in touch.</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <div class="badge-row">
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Local team</span>
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Visit and quote &middot; &pound;30</span>
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>&pound;30 back off your job</span>
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Tidy finish</span>
        </div>

        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>Fettle has been looking after London homes since 2023 – a boutique home-care service for a small, hand-picked roster of homeowners. We sit deliberately apart from the one-man-band handyman and the anonymous marketplace – fewer clients, better work, every job carrying a name and a reputation.</p>
          <p>A small permanent team of multi-skilled generalists does the day-to-day work. A short bench of personally-vetted specialists covers the jobs that need one – rendering, tree surgery – so there is always a proper hand for the job.</p>

          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <p>From a wonky fence to a fresh coat of paint, one team does the lot – painting, plastering, plumbing, fences, floors, carpet cleaning, end of tenancy cleans, odd jobs. The same faces each visit. People who know where the stopcock is, and which floorboard creaks.</p>
          <p>Dust sheets down, shoes off, radio low. Work you notice only by the fact everything simply works.</p>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <h2 class="prose" style="margin-top:0">Our patch</h2>
        <p class="prose" style="color:var(--ink-60); margin-top:-8px">A few of the neighbourhoods we know best &ndash; the patch itself now runs across north, northwest, west, southwest, south, and central London.</p>
        <div class="grid three" style="margin-top:20px">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Highbury &middot; N5</h3>
            <p>Plimsoll Road and around – Victorian terraces, kitchen extensions, gardens kept in order.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Highgate &middot; N6</h3>
            <p>Bishopswood Road and the hill – period homes, skylights, careful joinery.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Primrose Hill &middot; NW3</h3>
            <p>Wadham Gardens and nearby – parquet, staircases, the quiet upkeep of fine rooms.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Good hands, good work</h2>
          <p>Access is the point. We take on a few more homes each season, postcode by postcode, so we can keep doing right by the ones already on the list.</p>
          <p><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Contact</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
